# 5. Project Development Phase
**Project Name:** ComicVerse AI

## Directory Structure & Core Modules

```text
ComicVerseAI/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py              # FastAPI server initialization and route registration
│   ├── routes.py            # API request handlers and generation workflow orchestration
│   ├── gemini_flash.py      # Google Gemini Flash API integration for story outline
│   ├── gemini_pro.py        # Google Gemini Pro API integration for narration & dialogue
│   ├── image_generator.py   # Stable Diffusion via Hugging Face Diffusers integration
│   ├── layout_builder.py    # Combines panel text and images into structured layouts
│   └── exporters.py        # PDF compilation and formatting using FPDF
├── templates/
│   ├── index.html           # Input form interface for user story preferences
│   ├── comic_preview.html   # On-screen preview of generated panels
│   └── export_success.html  # Download confirmation and link page
├── static/
│   ├── css/                 # Custom styling for UI components
│   ├── panels/              # Storage directory for generated panel images
│   └── exports/             # Output directory for generated PDF files
├── .env                     # API key configuration
├── requirements.txt         # Project dependencies
└── README.md                # Project README

